inst:standard-odata a dl:LandscapeEntry, dl:DataStandardLandscapeEntry ; dl:identifier "odata" ; skos:prefLabel "OData"@en-GB ; dl:fullName "Open Data Protocol (v4)" ; dl:inStandardCategory tax:standard-category-contracts ; dl:firstReleaseYear "2014"^^xsd:gYear ; dl:governanceStatement "OASIS (originally Microsoft)" ; dl:statusStatement "Stable; v4.01 current (OASIS Standard since 2014)" ; dl:whyAStandard "OData is an OASIS Standard with a publicly-defined wire protocol and metadata format (CSDL). Multiple independent implementations exist across Microsoft, SAP, Salesforce, Oracle, and the OData4j / Olingo open-source stacks, so \"speaks OData\" is a portability claim rather than a vendor-lock-in label." ; dl:isNiche false ; dl:hasGovernanceType tax:governance-formal-standard ; dl:evidenceStatus "DIRECT_OBSERVATION" .
